  1106	
  1107	**R-4.91** The TLR is carried, not maintained; the service's duty is punctual, not custodial. Everything the standing report needs is in the bundle. [RULED (ADOPTED author) at adoption; the wording at :386-390 is the collaborator's record of the author's in-session resolution, his own quoted words there being "Item 5 adopted.", formal/spike/standing-probe/DECISION.md:130-140, 386-390]
  1108	
