  1392	### 5.3 Output
  1393	
  1394	**R-5.38** Verification yields one of `VALID_STRICT`, `VALID_DEGRADED(policy=...)`, `INVALID`, or `UNVERIFIABLE`: a typed result, never a bare `true`/`false`. A boolean collapses `INVALID` and `UNVERIFIABLE`, which is exactly where fail-open bugs hide. [REGISTERED prereg §4.6, docs/phase-0-prereg.md:555-562] [MODELLED `Verdicts`, formal/tla/P4_VerifierStates.tla:70]
