  1399	| `VALID_DEGRADED(policy=...)` | Accepted under an explicit, recorded weaker policy the verifier chose, inside the A1.2.1 waivable class; every check the policy still requires passed | prereg §3.1, p0:327-337 (the state list §4.6 points to); A1 §A1.2.1, a1:319-327; `ExactDegraded`, P4:174-175 |
