   137	|---|---|---|
   138	| P1 KMS ECDSA + gpg OpenPGP (P-256) | `INVALID` | — |
   139	| P2 KMS ECDSA + gpg OpenPGP (Ed25519, gpg's default) | `INVALID` | — |
   140	| P3 KMS ECDSA + gpg-agent `PKSIGN` over SHA-256(frame) | `VALID_STRICT` | The GPG slot is a raw DER signature; `gpg --verify` cannot check it. The "portable WHO layer" is gone |
