+## 12. C7 is an acceptance test, not a consequence of typed verdicts; its offline and revocation instructions conflict
+
+**Severity: High. Location:** `docs/V1-DERIVATION-DRAFT.md:35`, `:155-169`, `:256`, `:351`, `:369`.
